coverflowmp (2.0.7) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Add application icon and desktop integration
  * Added time delay functionality
  * Advanced features
  * Fast modus added
  * Newest features like extra keys, dynamic cover extraction while
    browser is showing already etc
  * Build changes
  * More build changes
  * Skip file auto import
  * Power saving inhibitor to prevent disruption
  * Showing clock in Pause Mode, progress and video time in browser
  * Subtract skip ranges in browser
  * Changed RESET function to optionally restrict to current folder
  * Bugfix for total videos times in Browser
  * Fall back to libmpv for browser durations when ffprobe is unavailable
  * Add ffmpeg and ffmpegthumbnailer as runtime dependencies
  * Bugfix for missing package from ffmpeg
  * Add missing indirect QML runtime dependencies for models and shapes
  * Minor packaging changes
  * Delete empty folder, style changes for overlay
  * Bugfixes
  * Bugfixes #2
  * Better handling of RESUME for videos with skip ranges
  * Added StartupWMClass to .desktop file
  * Show date and time in browser. Show note icon on audio delay overlay
  * Add flexible app configuration storage in SQLite with default
    browser background and folder list
  * Configurator added
  * Import/Merge old DB
  * Folder config type changed
  * Added folder config to configurator
  * INFO-Modus added with key Y
  * Episode info added with key I
  * Episode info added to configuration. Added play button to sidebar

